From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:55:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: cedrus: Limit VP8 to 2048 wide

Wider, the engine decodes wrong pictures with no error (2304 wide) or
times each frame out (3840). Advertised only to 2048, a wider stream goes
to a software decoder at once.
---
 drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_dec_vp8.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_dec_vp8.c b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_dec_vp8.c
index 1df8f20..2657302 100644
--- a/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_dec_vp8.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/sunxi/cedrus/cedrus_dec_vp8.c
@@ -952,9 +952,10 @@ static const struct v4l2_ctrl_config cedrus_dec_vp8_ctrl_configs[] = {
 	},
 };
 
+/* Past 2048 wide the engine decodes wrong pictures, then times out. */
 static const struct v4l2_frmsize_stepwise cedrus_dec_vp8_frmsize = {
 	.min_width	= 16,
-	.max_width	= 4096,
+	.max_width	= 2048,
 	.step_width	= 16,
 
 	.min_height	= 16,
-- 
2.47.3

